  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Sim Yeon-Hu, who believed that a person's location was determined from the beginning. However, due to an accident, he is injured and receives attention from others for the first time. He always thought, 'I'm not interested in things like attention-', but now he can't do it without other people's attention...! The only way to get attention from others. If I can only get people's attention by being 'pathetic'... I will be pitiful no matter what!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
